402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 269 0 R
/T (Across 8+ signature events, Access 2 Justice will bring together undergraduate students, professionals, community leaders, organizations, and Calgarians who believe that legal literacy should never be reserved for a select few. Because access to justice is not simply a legal issue, it shapes housing, employment, education, safety, opportunity, and everyday life. It affects everyone.)
/E (Across 8+ signature events, Access 2 Justice will bring together undergraduate students, professionals, community leaders, organizations, and Calgarians who believe that legal literacy should never be reserved for a select few. Because access to justice is not simply a legal issue, it shapes housing, employment, education, safety, opportunity, and everyday life. It affects everyone.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 269 0 R
/T (Our events are designed to do more than fill a room. They create spaces where ideas are exchanged, relationships are built, and people leave more informed, connected, and empowered than when they arrived. By partnering with Access 2 Justice, you are not only supporting events. You are helping build a city where knowledge is shared, communities are strengthened, and more people have the confidence to understand the systems that affect their lives.)
/E (Our events are designed to do more than fill a room. They create spaces where ideas are exchanged, relationships are built, and people leave more informed, connected, and empowered than when they arrived. By partnering with Access 2 Justice, you are not only supporting events. You are helping build a city where knowledge is shared, communities are strengthened, and more people have the confidence to understand the systems that affect their lives.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
